870
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:06,280
Ja ka tippkiirus on muljetavaldav.

871
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:06,280
218 kilomeetrit tunnis.

872
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:11,640
Aga see pole ainus asi.

873
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:11,640
