883
00:25:26,280 --> 00:25:28,520
See on KER-süsteem tööle asudes.

884
00:25:28,560 --> 00:25:30,520
See on just täpselt selleks mõeldud.

885
00:25:31,840 --> 00:25:33,760
Lisaks sellele,

886
00:25:31,840 --> 00:25:33,760
Ferrari on sellest teadlik.

887
00:25:33,800 --> 00:25:35,520
