987
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Jah, ma tean.

988
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Ja tänu sellele, et ma seda tean.

989
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Ma tean, et nad teavad seda.

990
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,640
